color therapies, and brass/copper elemental balancers."}, {"title": "Consecration & Activation Guidance", "body": "Guidance on energetic charging of spaces for peace, health, and commercial growth."}]'::jsonb,'["Homeowners experiencing recurrent health issues, friction, or financial instability", "Business owners and industrialists needing smoother cash flows, employee stability, and factory throughput", "Individuals purchasing new apartments, plots, or commercial offices wanting pre-possession audit", "Architects and interior designers wanting to incorporate authentic Vastu principles into their design plans"]'::jsonb,'On-site visits (Bhubaneswar, Odisha & across India) or highly detailed remote plan analysis via WhatsApp & Video.',null,null,'Book Vastu Consultation','VASTU PROGRAMME',null,null,'[{"q": "Do I need to break walls or make major structural alterations?", "a": "No. Dr. Anameka specializes in non-invasive remedies using elemental color frequencies, metals (copper/brass/iron), sacred geometry, and spatial realignment without demolition."}, {"q": "Can Vastu consultation be performed online with a floor plan?", "a": "Yes. With a to-scale floor plan and accurate compass orientation, an exhaustive 16-zone diagnostic audit and remedy plan can be conducted virtually."}]'::jsonb,'Vastu Transformation & Spatial Harmony Programme | Dr. Anameka S Panda','Scientific Vastu consultation and spatial harmony without demolition. Residential, commercial, and industrial 16-zone elemental balancing.',60,'published') on conflict (slug) do nothing;
