": "Pre-Construction Foundation Blessing", "body": "Guidance on foundation rituals (Bhoomi Pujan) and crystal grids for long-term protection."}]'::jsonb,'["Plot owners and builders preparing to begin construction on residential or commercial sites", "Factory and warehouse owners troubled by frequent machinery breakdowns, labor unrest, or accidents", "Residents experiencing chronic insomnia, unrefreshing sleep, or persistent illnesses resisting medical treatment", "Real estate investors looking to restore vitality to stagnant, unsellable properties"]'::jsonb,'On-site inspection with specialized dowsing and bio-energetic tools; remote plot map energetic review available.',null,null,'Consult on Land Healing','LAND HEALING',null,null,'[{"q": "What is Geopathic Stress?", "a": "Geopathic stress occurs when natural radiation from the earth is distorted by underground water streams, faults, or mineral deposits, creating harmful energetic lines that weaken human immunity and cause sleep disturbances."}, {"q": "How is it cured without digging up the entire floor or plot?", "a": "Through targeted geopathic neutralizing instruments, metallic resonance earth-staples, and specialized crystals placed at energetic nodes, creating a deflected protective envelope."}]'::jsonb,'Land & Geopathic Stress Healing Programme | Dr. Anameka S Panda','Detect and neutralize subterranean geopathic stress, Hartmann lines, and earth radiation for plots, residential homes, and commercial buildings.',70,'published') on conflict (slug) do nothing;
