ding Rituals", "body": "Daily breathwork, affirmations, and gemstone/salt therapies to maintain auric purity at home."}]'::jsonb,'["Individuals dealing with chronic stress, emotional exhaustion, grief, or burnout", "People feeling energetically drained after being around toxic colleagues or stressful environments", "Seekers wanting deeper meditation, inner peace, and spiritual awakening", "Working professionals, caregivers, and homemakers looking for restorative rejuvenation"]'::jsonb,'Available as both intimate in-person sessions and potent distant energy healing sessions (online video).',null,null,'Book Energy Healing Session','AURA HEALING',null,null,'[{"q": "Does distance energy healing really work?", "a": "Yes. Energy and quantum consciousness are not limited by physical space. Distant Reiki and Pranic healing sessions are equally potent, with clients feeling palpable warmth, lightness, and deep relaxation during the transmission."}, {"q": "Is this a substitute for medical treatment?", "a": "No. Energy healing is a complementary therapeutic modality that works synergistically with medical treatment by boosting the body''s natural restorative capacity and balancing the mind."}]'::jsonb,'Holistic Energy & Aura Healing Programme | Dr. Anameka S Panda','Chakra alignment, auric cleansing, and Usui Reiki energy healing for emotional peace, burnout recovery, and spiritual rejuvenation.',80,'published') on conflict (slug) do nothing;
