itle": "Custom Karmic Remedy Plan", "body": "Non-fear-based solutions—including specific mantra sadhanas, elemental remedies, and color alignment."}, {"title": "60-Minute Detailed Audio/Video Consultation", "body": "Live interactive discussion answering all specific life questions with compassion and clarity."}]'::jsonb,'["Individuals standing at life crossroads (career shift, business venture, marriage, relocation)", "Those undergoing stressful Saturn (Shani Sade Sati), Rahu/Ketu, or Mars (Mangal Dosha) periods seeking calm direction", "Spiritual seekers curious about past karmic debts (Rina Anubandha) and soul purpose", "Entrepreneurs choosing auspicious dates (Muhurta) for brand launches or contracts"]'::jsonb,'Online video consultation with comprehensive personalized chart dossier delivered prior to the session.',null,null,'Book Kundli Consultation','KUNDLI ALIGNMENT',null,null,'[{"q": "Are remedies expensive rituals or gemstones?", "a": "No. Dr. Anameka advocates sensible, sattvic, non-commercial remedies—such as mantra frequencies, directional vastu alignment, behavioral adjustments, and charitable acts—which bring enduring results without fear-mongering."}, {"q": "What details are needed for the Kundli reading?", "a": "Accurate date of birth, time of birth, and place of birth (city/state)."}]'::jsonb,'Occult Sciences & Kundli Alignment Programme | Dr. Anameka S Panda','Empowering Vedic Astrology & Janam Kundli analysis. Practical karmic remedies, planetary dasha navigation, and career & relationship guidance.',90,'published') on conflict (slug) do nothing;
